## Development Workflow

```bash
just bootstrap   # install all deps
just lint        # run linter (ruff)
just test        # run test suite
just build       # compile / package
just docs        # serve docs locally
```

## Claude Code Conventions

- Always run `just lint` and `just test` before committing
- Keep functions small and single-responsibility
- Write tests for all public functions
- Use conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, `refactor:`
- Never commit secrets — use `.env` (gitignored) or vault
- Type hints required on all public API
- Docstrings required on all public modules, classes, and functions

